    {
      "bbox": [
        153,
        1553,
        1794,
        1922
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "City cars are to be used for official business only, and assigned only to those public officials listed in this report as entitled to use such cars. Similarly, the use of official insignia must be limited as indicated in this report and in all other instances prohibited and, where heretofore otherwise issued, to be revoked forthwith.",
